This repository includes small still images (plugin/assets/thumbs/*.webp and docs/*)
rendered from the backdrop scenes of Anthropic's theme-examples plugin
(https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/tree/main/plugins/theme-examples),
Copyright Anthropic, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(plugin/assets/thumbs/LICENSE-theme-examples.txt). They were changed only by capturing a
single frame (or a few frames for the animated previews) and scaling it down.

It also includes one still each from two MIT-licensed theme plugins, made the same
way and kept with their licences in plugin/assets/thumbs:
- rainy-window.webp, from Rainy Window (https://github.com/ishuagrawal/claude-code-themes),
  Copyright (c) 2026 Ishu Agrawal (LICENSE-rainy-window.txt);
- garden.webp, the first frame of Garden's docs/preview.gif
  (https://github.com/cktang88/claude-garden-theme), Copyright (c) 2026 cktang88
  (LICENSE-garden.txt).

VibeSwitch does not include Backdrops artwork (not for redistribution). Where Backdrops
is installed, its own previews are read in place on the user's machine.

The website in docs/ is built with taste-skill (https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill),
MIT License; its kit files under docs/assets keep that licence (docs/assets/LICENSE-taste-skill.txt).
